SCOPE OF THIS LICENSE

The MIT license above applies ONLY to the contents of this `claude-plugin`
directory: the Claude Code plugin manifest, commands, agent definitions, skill
documentation, and the Python wrapper scripts in `skills/ocrdeskew/scripts/`.

It does NOT apply to the OCRDeskew application or its `ocrdeskew` command-line
program, which are proprietary software licensed separately. Nothing in this
license grants any right to use, copy, modify, or distribute OCRDeskew itself.

This plugin performs no OCR of its own. It orchestrates the separately licensed
`ocrdeskew` binary, which must be installed and licensed by the user. See
https://ocrdeskew.com for OCRDeskew's terms and pricing.
